// PSS v3.0 LRM — Example 86: replicate statement (page 163)
action my_test {
  rand int in [2..4] count;
  activity {
    parallel {
      replicate (count) {
        do A;
        do B;
      }
    }
  }
};

In Example 87, the execution of action my_test results in one execution of A as well as four executions of
